967146720044_7348271922241027561_n.png", "id": "1622106927959774", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035322_1622106931293107_7673111564532441971_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iVCDLuiCmaAQ7kNvwFm6Q4s&_nc_oc=Adohqb6kJF7hP8xDxB8e9sjWOU-N4fwtI1ivo6azas-jsi3XKdOGme7dj-0z0mYqfVY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQR1s2200tM2HEzML-kI3yHmqgr9C7J_JT545vhiIMmXA&oe=6B033928"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "38974909_908434023259504_3985756054659184676_n.png", "id": "925778641641882", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974738_925778644975215_4153897081312316798_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UCL7D2YhyhYQ7kNvwGLx-sV&_nc_oc=AdphrLECTysz3naK_vzsUwO6VnRhZirGFbrMw66hkvopEXo2xLxS38CNaFEvnqfEqtg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQamtjxWd6Mv1FQii3xZzhNTDAiAd9K3h91FB1XetgSSg&oe=6B031683"}, "display_name": "Magical Journey", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Millions of players of all ages have already loved the classic Match-3 game mechanics. Now you have a chance to dive deeper into these fantastic mechanics with the help of virtual reality. Line up three or more identical elements in a row, swapping two adjacent elements of the playing field. What could be easier? And what could be more joyful? \n\nForget about the real world and get immersed in a relaxing and calm magical atmosphere.\nExplore a bizarre world filled with a network of ancient magic portals.\n", "short_description": "Magical Journey is a mysterious world of adventures, full of ancient portals and relaxing surroundings based on classic match-3 mechanics. You play as Wizard, who is creating spells by means of runes, and with a magic wave of the wand, you are supposed to adjust ancient portals that open the path to marvelous new worlds."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_priv